<mxCell id="userB" value="User B&#10;(Editor)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#bbdefb;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="130" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="userBLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#1976d2;strokeColor=#1976d2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275" y="220" width="10" height="1250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="wsGateway" value="WebSocket&#10;Gateway" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="wsLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#388e3c;strokeColor=#388e3c" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="465" y="220" width="10" height="1250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="editorSvc" value="Document&#10;Editor Service&#10;(OT Engine)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#c8e6c9;strokeColor=#388e3c;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="130" width="140" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="editorLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#388e3c;strokeColor=#388e3c" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="665" y="220" width="10" height="1250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="redis" value="Redis&#10;(Cache)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9c4;strokeColor=#f57f17;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="130" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="redisLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#f57f17;strokeColor=#f57f17" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="855" y="220" width="10" height="1250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="postgres" value="PostgreSQL&#10;(Op-log)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1bee7;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="130" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="pgLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#7b1fa2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1035" y="220" width="10" height="1250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="kafka" value="Kafka&#10;(Operations)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffcc80;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="130" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="kafkaLine" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#ef6c00;strokeColor=#ef6c00" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215" y="220" width="10" height="1250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s3" value="S3&#10;(Snapshots)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffebee;strokeColor=#c62828;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="130" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3Line" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;fillColor=#c62828;strokeColor=#c62828" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1355" y="220" width="10" height="1250" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase1" value="PHASE 1: DOCUMENT OPEN + WEBSOCKET CONNECT" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fillColor=#e3f2fd;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="230" width="700" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s1" value="1. GET /docs/{docId}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="userALine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s2" value="2. GET doc:{docId}:state" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s3" value="3. MISS (cache expired)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s4" value="4. Fetch latest snapshot" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#c62828;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="s3Line"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s5" value="5. docs/{docId}/v10.txt.gz&#10;(gzip decompressed)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#c62828;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3Line" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s6" value="6. SELECT * FROM operations&#10;WHERE doc_id AND server_version &gt; 10" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="pgLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s7" value="7. 5 ops (v11-v15)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="pgLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s8" value="8. Replay ops&#10;snapshot + 5 ops → content='abc'" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="665" y="410" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="685" y="410" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s9" value="9. SET doc:{docId}:state 'abc' EX 1800" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s10" value="10. 200 OK {content: 'abc',&#10;current_version: 15}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="userALine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="note1" value="User A local state:&#10;content = 'abc'&#10;version = 15" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fillColor=#e3f2fd;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="510" width="120" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s11" value="11. User B connects WS" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="userBLine" target="wsLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s12" value="12. Broadcast user_joined" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="wsLine" target="userALine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s13" value="13. Init {content: 'abc', version: 15,&#10;active_users: [A,B]}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="wsLine" target="userBLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="note2" value="User B local state:&#10;content = 'abc'&#10;version = 15" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#1976d2;fillColor=#e3f2fd;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="620" width="120" height="45" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase2" value="PHASE 2: USER A INSERTS 'X' AT POSITION 0" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="680" width="700" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s14" value="14. User A types 'X'&#10;(optimistic: show locally)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="userALine" target="userALine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="115" y="710" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="135" y="710" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note3" value="A sees: 'Xabc'&#10;(local only)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="730" width="120" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s15" value="15. WS send {type: 'operation',&#10;op: {type: 'insert', pos: 0,&#10;content: 'X', client_version: 15}}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="userALine" target="wsLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s16" value="16. Forward op" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="wsLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s17" value="17. Validate: client_version=15&#10;matches Redis state version" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s18" value="18. VALID" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s19" value="19. Assign server_version = 16&#10;Apply op: 'abc' → 'Xabc'" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="665" y="900" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="685" y="900" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s20" value="20. SET doc:{docId}:state 'Xabc'" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s21" value="21. INSERT INTO operations&#10;(type, pos, content, server_version=16)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="pgLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s22" value="22. ACK" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="pgLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s23" value="23. Publish {doc_id, op, version: 16}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="kafkaLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s24" value="24. Broadcast to User B&#10;{type: 'operation', op, user: 'A'}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="wsLine" target="userBLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note4" value="B applies: 'abc' → 'Xabc'&#10;B version = 16" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="1040" width="120" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase3" value="PHASE 3: USER B DELETES CHAR AT POSITION 1 (CONCURRENT, BEFORE SEEING A'S INSERT)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fillColor=#fff3e0;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="1090" width="700" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note5" value="B's local state is still 'abc' version 15&#10;(A's insert hasn't arrived yet due to network delay)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fillColor=#fff3e0;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="1120" width="120" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s25" value="25. User B deletes 'b' at pos 1&#10;(local optimistic)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="userBLine" target="userBLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="275" y="1190" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="295" y="1190" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note6" value="B sees: 'ac'&#10;(local only)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fillColor=#fff3e0;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="1210" width="120" height="35" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s26" value="26. WS send {type: 'operation',&#10;op: {type: 'delete', pos: 1,&#10;content: 'b', client_version: 15}}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#1976d2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="userBLine" target="wsLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="phase4" value="PHASE 4: OT TRANSFORMATION (SERVER RESOLVES CONFLICT)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#c62828;fillColor=#ffebee;align=left;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;rounded=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="1280" width="700" height="25" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s27" value="27. Forward B's op" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="wsLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s28" value="28. B's client_version=15, but&#10;Redis current version=16&#10;(A's insert already applied)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s29" value="29. Mismatch: need OT transform" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="redisLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s30" value="30. Fetch A's op (v16):&#10;{type: 'insert', pos: 0, content: 'X'}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="pgLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s31" value="31. Op v16" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="pgLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s32" value="32. OT TRANSFORM:&#10;B wanted to delete pos 1 in 'abc'&#10;But A inserted 'X' at pos 0&#10;→ B's delete position shifts RIGHT by +1&#10;Transformed: delete pos 2 (not pos 1)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#c62828;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="665" y="1420" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="685" y="1420" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="otNote" value="OT RULE: insert-before-your-position&#10;→ shift your position RIGHT (+1)&#10;delete-before-your-position&#10;→ shift your position LEFT (-1)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#c62828;fillColor=#ffebee;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="1340" width="700" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s33" value="33. Apply transformed op:&#10;'Xabc' → delete pos 2 → 'Xac'" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="665" y="1460" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="685" y="1460" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s34" value="34. Assign server_version = 17" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="editorLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="665" y="1480" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="685" y="1480" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s35" value="35. SET doc:{docId}:state 'Xac'" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="redisLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s36" value="36. INSERT INTO operations&#10;(type: 'delete', pos: 2, server_version: 17)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7b1fa2;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="pgLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s37" value="37. Publish {doc_id, op, version: 17}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#ef6c00;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="editorLine" target="kafkaLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="s38" value="38. Broadcast transformed op to User A&#10;{type: 'operation', op: delete pos 2}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="wsLine" target="userALine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note7" value="A applies: 'Xabc' → delete pos 2 → 'Xac'&#10;A version = 17&#10;CONVERGED!" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1430" width="120" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="s39" value="39. Send transformed op to User B&#10;{type: 'operation', op: delete pos 2}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fontSize=10" edge="1" parent="1" source="wsLine" target="userBLine"><mxGeometry width="80" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="note8" value="B applies: 'Xabc' → delete pos 2 → 'Xac'&#10;B version = 17&#10;CONVERGED!" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=center;fontSize=10;rounded=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="1430" width="120" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="convergence" value="CONVERGENCE GUARANTEE: Both users applied ops in SERVER ORDER (v16 A's insert, v17 B's transformed delete) → SAME FINAL STATE 'Xac' ✓" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#388e3c;fillColor=#e8f5e9;align=center;fontSize=11;rounded=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="1420" width="700" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

<mxCell id="interview" value="INTERVIEW KEY QUESTIONS&#10;&#10;Q1: What if no OT transformation?&#10;A1: Both clients apply ops in different order or positions → divergent states. A sees 'Xac', B sees 'ac' → data corruption. OT ensures server-assigned sequential order + position adjustment = convergence.&#10;&#10;Q2: Why server-assigned version instead of client timestamps?&#10;A2: Client clocks can be skewed (NTP drift, timezone differences). Server-assigned sequence (atomic counter) is single source of truth — no ambiguity in ordering.&#10;&#10;Q3: OT vs CRDT difference?&#10;A3: OT needs central server to assign order + transform concurrent ops. CRDT operations commute (any order → same result) using unique IDs per character — no server needed, works offline, but higher memory overhead (IDs + tombstones for deleted chars). Google Docs = OT. Figma = CRDT.&#10;&#10;Q4: What if Redis cache goes down during editing?&#10;A4: Editor Service falls back to PostgreSQL (fetch snapshot from S3 + replay ops). Slower (200ms vs 1ms) but still works. Reconciliation Service rebuilds Redis state from op-log. No data loss — op-log is source of truth.&#10;&#10;Q5: How does offline editing sync work?&#10;A5: User types offline → ops stored in IndexedDB with last_known_version=15. Network returns → client sends sync_request{last_known_version:15} → server replies with ops 16-20 → client applies server ops first → OT-transforms local queued ops (adjust positions) → sends batch. If irreconcilable conflict (two people rewrote same paragraph) → merge modal pops up.&#10;&#10;Q6: Why cursor positions in Redis HASH with TTL=5 min?&#10;A6: 100 cursor updates/sec/user × 100 editors = 10K writes/sec, all ephemeral (no recovery value). Redis HASH cursors:{docId} stores {user_id → {pos, selection}} with TTL, removed on disconnect. NEVER persist to DB — pure real-time state.&#10;&#10;Q7: What triggers snapshot generation?&#10;A7: Reconciliation Service (Kafka consumer) counts ops since last snapshot. If count >= 50 OR 5 min elapsed → fetch snapshot from S3 + replay ops → gzip compress → upload new snapshot to S3 → update PostgreSQL snapshots table. Balances storage cost vs replay time (worst-case 50 ops ~50ms).&#10;&#10;Q8: How does version history work?&#10;A8: Every snapshot = one version with timestamp + user who triggered. GET /docs/{docId}/version lists all snapshots DESC. View version: fetch from S3, show read-only preview with diff vs current. Rollback: create 'replace_all' op with target version content → new snapshot (never mutate history) → broadcast to all editors → clients reload." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e3f2fd;strokeColor=#1976d2;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1510" width="2100" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
